onymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/0cdce2f0153a60735b9e9975db73ab09.poster.avif?t=1724687198\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/0cdce2f0153a60735b9e9975db73ab09.webm?t=1724687198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Bring your discoveries to the Lumira Sea Lab. The researchers here have an endless desire for information about sea creatures, and what makes them unique. Your findings can work towards nifty upgrades for your boat and even your seal companion.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045520/extras/4d8ee83b5782bab464b2f7ebb30bc947.avif?t=1724687198\" width=616 height=142 /></span><br><br>There have been reports of mysterious creatures sighted in the area. Some say they are an omen of misfortune, harbingers of unwelcome changes. Others embrace their presence, eager to find out the mystery of their origin.<br><br>Will you help uncover what these strange creatures might mean for the world?",
